# Hermes secrets — copy to ~/.hermes/.env and uncomment one provider.
# This file is read by `hermes` at startup; secrets live here, non-secret
# config (model name, gateways) is set via `hermes config set ...` and
# lands in ~/.hermes/config.yaml.
#
# Pick a provider by setting its API key, then run `hermes model` to choose
# which model to use. You can switch providers later by editing this file.

# --- OpenAI -------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: a ChatGPT (Plus/Pro/Team) subscription is NOT the same thing.
# Get an API key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys — billed separately.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# --- Anthropic (Claude) -------------------------------------------------
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- OpenRouter (one key, ~200 models) ----------------------------------
# https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# --- Nous Portal (upstream happy path) ----------------------------------
# Run `hermes setup --portal` instead — it handles auth and writes this.
# NOUS_PORTAL_API_KEY=...
